    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877650/extras/ee72290035f276c7351168b81fbf57a0.webp?t=1754602325\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877650/extras/2a5d907e079753a69401244b6ad47f0d.poster.avif?t=1754602325\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877650/extras/2a5d907e079753a69401244b6ad47f0d.webm?t=1754602325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877650/extras/2a5d907e079753a69401244b6ad47f0d.mp4?t=1754602325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><i>Changing terrain is your main weapon now</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877650/extras/38807d14a16fe644132e2a5441b0301e.poster.avif?t=1754602325\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877650/extras/38807d14a16fe644132e2a5441b0301e.webm?t=1754602325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877650/extras/38807d14a16fe644132e2a5441b0301e.mp4?t=1754602325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Changing units, is <span class=\"bb_strike\">your sidearm</span> very helpful too</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>You are not a general - you are a GOD.</strong><br>No need to bark orders at troops - instead, reshape the land itself: raise mountains, flood the valleys, and bend the battlefield to your will. Because you can.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forget traditional commands - here, <strong>your divine influence controls the tide of battle.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udee0 Gameplay Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>100% Predictable Combat</strong> - No RNG. Plan everything in advance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Indirect Unit Control</strong> - Units move on their own, following fixed pathfinding rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Terraform the Battlefield</strong> - Your powers let you reshape terrain and even alter unit classes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roguelite Replayability</strong> - Build a unique deck of spells and units on every run. Unlock new heroes with different starting styles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877650/extras/22260a1a21333109e43fd53967636f56.webp?t=1754602325\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877650/extras/b35c7afc17efeca2a86e3f63c96d5e45.poster.avif?t=1754602325\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877650/extras/b35c7afc17efeca2a86e3f63c96d5e45.webm?t=1754602325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877650/extras/b35c7afc17efeca2a86e3f63c96d5e45.mp4?t=1754602325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877650/extras/a26f72b83847378b8b3a9ebcbcf62de2.webp?t=1754602325\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1877650/extras/5e3eb35ddb3eb0c649e84d40c01a9a